The first APM package for the linked.archi approach: six Agent Skills for asking
architecture questions of an RDF graph produced by the linked.archi converters.
See PROPOSAL.md for the design record, the evidence each decision rests on, and
the decision log.

The vocabulary this package targets is published at https://meta.linked.archi/
(the linked-archi-meta repository) and is licensed CC-BY-4.0. This package
contains no copy of those ontologies; it binds to their namespace IRIs.
